<title>FRANCE: PRESS DIGEST - Algeria - Feb 10.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Algeria - Feb 10.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Algerian press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>AL KHABAR</p>
<p>- Twelve opposition parties to take part in debates over mechanisms to supervise planned general elections.</p>
<p>LIBERTE</p>
<p>- New administrative division for Algiers.</p>
<p>EL WATAN</p>
<p>- Algeria officially invites foreign observers to monitor parliamentary elections.</p>
<p>EL MOUDJAHID</p>
<p>- Algerian people celebrates Eid al Fitr to strengthen solidarity and brotherhood.</p>
<p>L'AUTHENTIQUE</p>
<p>- Mohamed Madani's assassination plunges soccer community into mourning.</p>
</text>
